


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_c1649d90:


    "休息时间。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_76d1c326:



    voice "2HI_1377"
    hina "「我去趟洗手间」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_dd7adcf0:


    "阳菜和文说了一声后就离开了座位。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_17fbee70:


    "文目送阳菜离开教室后，起身走到伦的座位边。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_8aa340c4:



    voice "2RI_1314"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_e8a303e1:


    "伦看着窗外发呆。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_4a1439a6:



    voice "2FU_1110"
    fumi "「绪方同学」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_eb2b135e:



    voice "2RI_1315"
    rin "「嗯，怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_e5769667:



    voice "2FU_1111"
    fumi "「果然是昨晚和夏目同学发生了什么吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_d5957d63:



    voice "2RI_1316"
    rin "「真是的，从昨天起你都问几次了？担心过度了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_14355cf4:


    "没错。文已经问过好几次了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_b9978291:


    "伦和阳菜回到房间的瞬间，文就察觉了。乍一看与平时没有区别，但气氛隐约有些僵硬。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_7feaf9f0:


    "无论是同时问两个人还是分别询问，她们都说没有发生任何事。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_11ae5c2d:



    voice "2RI_1317"
    rin "「看起来有那么奇怪吗～？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_c06dc7da:


    "伦还是装作若无其事，打算敷衍过去。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_26a49e26:



    voice "2FU_1112"
    fumi "「不好意思，就是有那么奇怪」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_119ca011:


    "但文没有上她的当。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_6ce6910c:



    voice "2RI_1318"
    rin "「都说了什么也没有啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_161241f2:


    "伦再次否定道。这次，她错开了视线。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_4b6e09a7:



    voice "2FU_1113"
    fumi "「………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_10187801:



    voice "2RI_1319"
    rin "「只是有些误会罢了。没关系，很快就会和好」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_ee7cbfc3:


    "敌不过文无言的压力，伦只好坦白。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_f1971e72:



    voice "2FU_1114B"
    fumi "「有什么和好的契机吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_e3314110:



    voice "2RI_1320"
    rin "「呃，那什么，恩爱一下就能和好啦。毕竟阳菜那么单纯」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_1df76782:



    voice "2FU_1115"
    fumi "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_c09b976d:


    "文察觉到了：是惯例的那个。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_3b1143eb:



    voice "2RI_1321"
    rin "「所以呢，抱歉，虽然有些突然，今天能拜托你吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_aa66ae8d:


    "伦合掌请求文道。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_f361b67e:



    voice "2FU_1116"
    fumi "「我知道了。那圣夜——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_2bb77541:



    voice "2MI_1032"
    miyako "「嗯。正好我想和文喝杯茶再回宿舍」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_72464c47:


    "文只是朝圣夜子看了一眼，她便立马明白过来。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_97967429:



    voice "2RI_1322"
    rin "「一直以来真是有劳二位了……话说，好难为情啊～」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_6277e76b:


    "伦虽然在笑，但表情比平常略显僵硬。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_02_789ec55d:



    voice "2FU_1117"
    fumi "「………」"
